   37|       |    /*  [... a b c] is a shorthand for ... + a<<104 + b<<52 + c<<0 mod n.
   38|       |     *  for 0 <= x <= 4, px is a shorthand for sum(a[i]*b[x-i], i=0..x).
   39|       |     *  for 4 <= x <= 8, px is a shorthand for sum(a[i]*b[x-i], i=(x-4)..4)
